message: "If you use this benchmark, cite this repository, release, and the exact commit used."
title: "ITAM Asset Typing Benchmark"
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-11
authors:
  - name: "GAbra"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GAbra/itam-asset-typing-benchmark"
url: "https://github.com/GAbra/itam-asset-typing-benchmark/releases/tag/v2.0.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible synthetic IT asset typing research benchmark comparing
  HashMap + BitSet, compiled CEL and DMN / Apache KIE. Version 2.0.0 freezes
  the realistic multi-source synthetic validation track, conservative conflict
  handling, robustness experiments, rule-scaling measurements and Software
  Taxonomy v3 before external validation on independently labelled real-world
  or appropriately anonymized production-like data.
keywords:
  - ITAM
  - asset classification
  - asset typing
  - benchmark
  - CEL
  - DMN
  - robustness
